WEBVTT

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:38.130
I'm starving.

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:42.540
And today's dinner... is sukiyaki!

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:47.040
SUKIYAKIIIII!

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:52.040
Sukiyaki!

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:54.710
I've been waiting for you, darling!

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:56.040
L-Lum?!

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:58.040
Why are you wearing that whacky outfit?!

00:01:58.040 --> 00:01:59.630
We don't have time for that!

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:00.830
You're coming with me right now!

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:02.750
Hold on! I was about to eat sukiyaki...

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:04.210
Just forget the sukiyaki and do what I say,

00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:06.960
or you'll be getting a taste of
my electric shock instead!

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:09.040
I've already opened the
interdimensional passageway!

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:11.250
Wh-what the hell is that?!

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:13.630
We have to hurry. Everyone is waiting!

00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:15.750
Where exactly are you taking me?

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:19.040
You're going to participate in Setsubun
with me on my home planet, darling!

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:22.420
Setsubun is an annual event
that's very important to my people!

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:23.790
Yeah, well, my sukiyaki is just as important!

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:26.000
It's a meal that I only get to eat
about once a year!

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:27.880
Ah! There's no time!

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:30.210
None of the festivities can start
until I get there!

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:35.210
Nooooooo! My sukiyakiiiiiiiiiiiiiii!

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:36.540
Good Day For a Departure

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:40.960
ONI CLAN

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:50.420
You're late, Lum.

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:51.960
Sorry about that, Daddy!

00:02:51.960 --> 00:02:54.330
Alright! Let's get this Setsubun started!

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:56.290
Wh-what kind of event is that?

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:58.670
Because it looks like
you're about to go to war!

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:01.330
Aye, you hit the nail on the head.
We're about to head into a real battle!

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:03.290
You better gear yourself up, boyo!

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:05.000
Aw man!

00:03:05.170 --> 00:03:09.080
I can tell just by looking at them
that fighting these guys is really gonna hurt!

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:12.040
Get a load of this kid!

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:14.290
Pain is the least of your worries, trust me!

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:17.460
Watch it, chumps! You better show
some respect to the Lucky Gods!

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:19.000
We're gonna crush the lot of ya!

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:22.920
Oh shaddup, ya pompous windbags!
You're about as lucky as a broken mirror!

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:24.500
Didja hear that, guys?

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:27.080
The big fatso over there
is trying to pick a fight with us!

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:29.790
Y-you gotta be kidding...

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:32.460
Am I about to die on some alien planet
without ever eating my sukiyaki?

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:33.880
No way!

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:36.750
SCREW THIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIS!

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:39.880
I thought I just heard Ataru's voice...

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:41.330
Honey, can we eat now?

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:43.790
Not yet, you know we have to wait for Ataru!

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:46.500
Well, he better not be out there
causing trouble with hoodlums!

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:47.580
I'm worried.

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:49.880
Something awful might have happened to him.

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:51.750
I mean, he's a glutton.

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:54.540
There's no way he'd just pass up
on the chance to eat sukiyaki!

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.540
Give 'em hell!

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:00.710
No! I'm out!

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:02.130
I don't wanna die!

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:14.630
Hey! Aim before you throw, guys!

00:04:14.630 --> 00:04:16.380
Go, go, red team!

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:18.040
Go, go, white team!

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:20.210
Well, this is dumb.
It's just a game of basket tower toss...

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:21.830
C'mon! C'mon! C'mon!

00:04:22.210 --> 00:04:24.920
You wanna lose or what?!
Put your back into it!

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:26.630
Whoa! Hot babe alert!

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:27.790
Comin' through!
Go, go, go!

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:28.290
Go, go, go!

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:29.080
Ouch!

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.500
Hello pretty lady!

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:33.170
Can I get your digits and address?

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:35.580
What the?! Who the hell are you?!

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:37.580
Hey! You get down from there right now!

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:39.920
Hey there, sexy.

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:43.290
Darling! Benten is one of my longtime friends!

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:45.210
You're in for a world of hurt
if you cheat on me with her!

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:46.210
Don't be stupid!

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:48.420
There's no way I'm gonna pass up
on a hottie like this!

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:50.250
My mouth is watering already!

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:52.500
Uh oh!

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:55.250
Dear! Did you just hear Ataru's voice, too?

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:56.420
Y-yeah...

00:04:57.880 --> 00:05:00.000
Ataru? Are you here?

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:04.210
You never should have suggested
that we just eat Ataru's share!

00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:06.960
Well there's nothing we can do about it now!

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:10.040
Besides, I'm pretty sure you're the one
who ate the majority of the meat!

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:11.920
I beg your pardon!

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:18.750
I just came to see if your son was okay

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:21.080
after I had a dream
that he ended up in Hell...

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:23.920
Unfortunately, it seems his ghost
is already among us.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:26.000
So, that voice we heard was his spirit?

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:28.710
He may have been a huge dumbass,
but he was my only son!

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:30.540
Oh, my poor boy!

00:05:30.540 --> 00:05:35.330
Well, it seems to me that he was strongly fixated
upon something at the time of his death.

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:38.460
The teachings of Buddha say that
we should guide his soul into Heaven

00:05:38.460 --> 00:05:39.880
by honoring him with a service.

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:42.130
I think we already know
what the problem is...

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:45.830
Oh ho! I can't say I've met a spirit
that stuck around just for sukiyaki.

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:47.460
Such a deprived boy.

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:50.790
Look here, I don't have to take any lip
from you about my family's eating habits!

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:53.000
In my experience, the best method
of appeasing a ghost like this

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:54.540
is by performing a segaki ritual.

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:55.750
Segaki ritual?

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:59.750
We hold a sukiyaki party in front of his alter
where everybody gets to chow down!

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.630
You seem awfully happy about the idea...

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.670
GRUMBLE

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:04.670
Hey, Miss Benten!

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:07.330
Whaddya say we go watch a movie together?

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:10.080
Uh, are you nuts?
You're flirting with me in front of your wife.

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:11.210
It's not a problem!

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:12.080
What?!

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:14.130
We're gonna get divorced soon.

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:16.580
Get it together, Lum!

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:19.000
Your job is to keep that basket steady!

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:20.460
But Daddy!

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:24.630
This is my chance to get
under Lum's skin a little...

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:27.040
So hey, do you think I'm better than Lum?

00:06:27.040 --> 00:06:30.670
In terms of food, Lum is like boiled tofu
while you're a tasty serving of sukiyaki, baby!

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:31.960
Am I really that great?

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:33.420
P-please let me wolf you down!

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:34.880
Be my guest.

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:38.580
NO MORE! STOOOOP!

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:40.420
Wait! You'll throw it off balance!

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:43.750
YOU'RE DEAD MEAT!

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:44.500
Nice!

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:49.540
O-oh no, the basket fell!

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:51.040
We're screwed!

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:53.420
This can't be happening...!

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:56.750
So...

00:06:57.040 --> 00:07:01.420
The match is over and the winner of this year's
Setsubun battle has been decided.

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:04.290
Congratulations to the white team.

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:07.920
Now, as per tradition, one person will be
chosen to face punishment.

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:10.380
Oh no! P-please don't be me!

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:13.960
Yikes! Are we gonna have a repeat of
that horrific tragedy from last year?!

00:07:13.960 --> 00:07:15.710
We'll do it the same as we always do.

00:07:15.710 --> 00:07:17.670
Whoever was the biggest
bonehead on the losing team

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:19.460
will be the one to face the music!

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:22.880
Usually, it's really difficult
to make that choice.

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:25.130
But this year, I think everyone agrees.

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:27.500
It's gotta be my son-in-law over there!

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:28.540
Whaaaat?!

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:29.710
Huh?

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:32.670
Hold on! You can't, Daddy!

00:07:32.670 --> 00:07:33.790
What's gonna happen to me?!

00:07:33.960 --> 00:07:36.210
Ah, I'm stuffed!

00:07:36.210 --> 00:07:38.000
I gotta say, sukiyaki sure is tasty!

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:39.750
I don't even remember
the last time I had some.

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:41.040
So, uh, now that we're done eating...

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:42.000
can we move on?

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:43.630
Oh! Yes, of course.

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:45.460
I suppose I should take my leave soon.

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:47.960
What about the ritual for Ataru?!

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:49.920
You better say at least one prayer,
or so help me god...!

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:51.880
Oh, that's right.

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:54.500
Sorry, the food was so good
I nearly forgot.

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:57.000
You stupid bald chowhound!

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:58.580
Just calm down, honey!

00:07:58.920 --> 00:08:02.380
Let us gather around this
devotional graphic of sukiyaki

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:05.750
and pay our final respects
to the soul of your son.

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:10.040
Sendai, Kobe, Hida, Omi, Matsusaka,
Tajima, Yonezawa, Yamagata.

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:15.330
Thigh, fillet, rump, sirloin, brisket,
flank steak, and tongue with salt!

00:08:17.130 --> 00:08:17.790
Ataru!

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:18.630
Ataru!

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:19.630
Yikes.

00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:21.710
Out with evil!

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:23.420
And in with luck!

00:08:23.420 --> 00:08:24.830
Darling!
Out with evil!

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:25.460
Out with evil!

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:27.630
And in with luck!

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:30.750
Out with evil!

00:08:31.170 --> 00:08:32.580
Ow! Ow! Owies!

00:08:32.580 --> 00:08:34.330
He's being tortured by Oni in Hell...

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:36.750
That's no surprise considering how he lived.

00:08:36.920 --> 00:08:40.290
Shucks, he really did end up
in purgatory after all.

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:42.080
The poor soul.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:48.630
Achoo!

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:54.170
Crud... I caught another stupid cold.

00:08:54.420 --> 00:08:58.170
Are you feeling okay?
Would you like some apple slices, Ataru?

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:02.080
Why the hell are you here?!

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:03.670
I came to pay you a visit.

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:05.880
Ataru! We're here to lift your spirits!

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:07.540
Miss Lum! It's a pleasure to see-

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:10.080
Miss Lum is out, it seems.

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:13.290
Damn! That's the whole reason
we even came to see Ataru...

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:17.750
He probably kicked her out or something.
I feel for Lum, that poor girl.

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:18.630
Hey, Ataru!

00:09:18.630 --> 00:09:20.210
Tell us what happened to Lum right now!

00:09:20.380 --> 00:09:23.460
Enough, you guys!
Ataru is sick and needs rest!

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:24.460
Shinobu!

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:26.250
I knew you still had the hots for me!

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:27.750
Get your hands off!

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:30.580
And after I took time out of my
busy schedule to come see you...

00:09:30.580 --> 00:09:32.210
Whatever, you just wanted to see Lum!

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:33.250
Obviously.

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:34.500
Well it sucks to be you.

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:37.130
Lum went off to Neptune
to see an alien friend of hers.

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:38.000
Curses!

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:40.630
This is the worst possible timing ever!

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:43.250
Too cold!

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:44.170
Snow?

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:47.000
Hrmm. I feel a very strange presence among us.

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:48.710
I suggest you check the closet.

00:09:48.710 --> 00:09:49.670
Should we open it?

00:09:49.670 --> 00:09:50.540
I'm scared.

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:52.210
Have no fear, Miss Shinobu.

00:09:52.210 --> 00:09:53.710
I'll open it on the count of three.

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:55.460
One, two...!

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:08.830
Oh no, Ataru!

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:09.960
Dig him up!

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:18.210
Oh my, how wonderful.
There are so many men here.

00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:19.830
It's a Yuki-onna!

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:22.880
Not so fast, foul demon!
I shall expel you from this plac-

00:10:22.880 --> 00:10:23.710
Wah!

00:10:23.710 --> 00:10:25.000
What was that for?!

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:27.130
A woman this beautiful
couldn't possibly be a demon.

00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:28.040
Crazy monk.

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:29.420
Quit thinking with your crotch!

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:32.080
You can't let this
closet lurking demon trick you!

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:33.710
Dear me, how rude.

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:36.750
I can tell when I'm not welcome.

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:38.750
Aw, boo. You're leaving already?

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:40.540
Would you care to guide me back?

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:41.500
Sure!

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:43.330
Allow me to be your escort, ma'am!

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:44.580
How wonderful.

00:10:44.960 --> 00:10:47.040
Hold up. I thought you were sick.

00:10:49.130 --> 00:10:51.630
What on earth is going on with this closet?

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:52.080
Oyuki

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:55.130
Lum turned it into an interdimensional
passageway or something the other day.

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:57.420
You boys sure have strange tastes.

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:58.460
Why did you tag along?

00:10:58.460 --> 00:10:59.920
Please, come right this way.

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:02.540
This is spooky, Mendo.
Let's go back.

00:11:02.540 --> 00:11:04.420
One problem,
the exit seems to have vanished...

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:07.380
You must keep up with the group
or you'll be left behind.

00:11:07.380 --> 00:11:09.540
This passage crosses through dimensions.

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:11.630
You'll get stuck in here forever
if you get lost.

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:13.670
Oh no! Please wait for me!

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:15.330
Yikes, how scary!

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:22.210
Your ladyship!

00:11:20.210 --> 00:11:22.040
Your ladyship!

00:11:22.210 --> 00:11:24.250
Oyuki!

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:24.080
Oyuki!

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:25.380
That was Lum's voice!

00:11:25.380 --> 00:11:26.670
I'm coming!

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:31.290
She's gone.

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:32.960
C'mon, Moroboshi! Go after her!

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:33.830
No way!

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:36.130
Don't give me that, you dimwit!

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:46.380
Darling?!

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:52.710
Darling!

00:11:53.210 --> 00:11:55.790
What are you doing here, darling?

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:57.710
I could ask you the same thing!

00:11:57.710 --> 00:12:00.250
I came here to spend time with
my old friend, Oyuki!

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:02.460
Wait, does that mean we're on Neptune?

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:04.750
So you're Lum's husband
I've heard so much about.

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:06.040
Nice to meet you.

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:08.250
Then I suppose this must be
Miss Third Wheel.

00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:10.500
Lum has told me a lot about you as well.

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.210
Who are you calling a third wheel?!

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:15.080
Look, it's a guy! A real guy!

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:16.790
Wow! This is great!

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:18.830
The mistress brought him
along with her, I guess.

00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:19.960
Why hello there.

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:21.540
It is an honor to meet you.

00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:23.250
Oh, the pleasure is all ours!

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:26.380
The majority of men on our planet
have to go away for work,

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:28.000
so we need help clearing the snow.

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:29.040
Bless your hearts!

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:31.040
Work those shovels hard!

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:32.920
Any guy can be popular with the ladies here.

00:12:32.920 --> 00:12:35.670
Yeah, good-looks don't move snow after all!

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:38.540
Oh my! Look at him go!

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:40.170
He's so strong and sturdy!

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:41.330
I'm your man!

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:45.710
Come. Mr. Ataru and Miss Third Wheel
can relax in my mansion.

00:12:45.710 --> 00:12:47.750
Like I said, I'm not a third wheel!

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:49.330
Achoo!

00:12:49.630 --> 00:12:51.460
Darling? Are you all right?

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:54.580
I got buried under a mountain of snow
in my room earlier.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:56.130
It really sucked...

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:57.920
We opened an interdimensional hole

00:12:57.920 --> 00:13:00.420
to dispose of all the snow
that we have to shovel around here.

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:04.830
I thought for sure our mistress was doomed
after she fell right into it earlier!

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.710
But that was my room you dumped it into!

00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:09.380
Pardon me. I need to remove
my insulated clothing.

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:12.790
Now, where were we?

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:15.250
Uh, I was just saying that... well...

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:17.170
Keep chucking that snow my way!

00:13:17.170 --> 00:13:18.380
I don't mind a bit!

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:20.420
Great. Let me prepare us some tea.

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:22.420
Oh please. You're fawning over her
like a lovesick puppy.

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:24.750
Darling! You better get
your mind out of the gutter!

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:25.630
Shaddup!

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:28.420
Oyuki is nothing like either of you.
She's a true maiden!

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:29.330
Jerk!

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:31.130
Darliiiiing....!

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:35.790
Take this, you two-timing scumbag!

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:39.500
I just can't figure it out.

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:41.040
Why is every woman in my life so violent?

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:43.420
Oyuki is a literal angel compared to them...

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:46.080
Oh my. Is there a problem, good sir?

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:47.330
Lady Oyuki!

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:49.250
You'll catch cold out here.

00:13:49.250 --> 00:13:51.130
Let's hurry back to the room.

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:53.040
I'm afraid I can't do that.

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:54.380
Because if I go back there...

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:56.130
I'm a dead man!

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:56.830
Gosh...

00:13:59.080 --> 00:14:01.250
Well, you can just rest here for now.

00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:02.500
Achoo!

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:04.790
Oh my. Are you running a fever?

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:05.880
Lady Oyuki!

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:08.580
You seem to be getting hotter
and hotter by the minute, sir.

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:11.500
Of course. It's because you're just
too beautiful to look at.

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:13.460
Oh! We mustn't!

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:16.830
Don't give in to temptation! It's too obscene!

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:18.630
Wh-whoa! You're way more aggressive
than I thought, Lady Oyuki!
Oh my! This is so wrong!

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:19.380
Wh-whoa! You're way more aggressive
than I thought, Lady Oyuki!
Please don't go any further, sir!

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:21.580
D-damn, I can't hold back anymore!
Please don't go any further, sir!

00:14:21.580 --> 00:14:25.040
But this is forbidden love.
You're already married to Lum, aren't you?

00:14:25.040 --> 00:14:27.380
Be that as it may,
we've already come too far to stop!

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:29.290
Oh my! How outrageous!

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:31.880
We mustn't engage in such
vulgar deeds, good sir!

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:34.290
It's too much! Ahhhh!

00:14:34.710 --> 00:14:36.920
BWAAAAAARGH!

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:38.580
Wh-what the hell?!

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:40.540
That's my manservant, B-Bo.

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:43.920
He cherishes me like
an elder sister, you see.

00:14:43.920 --> 00:14:47.130
You better get your grubby hands
off my mistress, little man!

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:48.500
Holy crap! It's a friggin' yeti!

00:14:48.500 --> 00:14:49.960
B-Bo! Stop that!

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:51.290
B-Bo!

00:14:54.170 --> 00:14:56.250
And just when things were getting good...

00:14:57.420 --> 00:14:58.880
What was that? An earthquake?

00:15:03.830 --> 00:15:05.830
Get over here!

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:07.460
I'm gonna tear you to shreds!

00:15:12.880 --> 00:15:15.290
GRRR

00:15:12.880 --> 00:15:15.290
GRRR

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:18.790
Lord help me!

00:15:23.130 --> 00:15:23.880
Ataru!

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:24.960
Where's my darling?!

00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:27.080
He just jumped into the portal
with some big yeti!

00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:28.080
Argh!

00:15:28.080 --> 00:15:30.330
I wanted to strangle him
with my own two hands!

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:31.250
What a disaster.

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:34.420
B-Bo is being far too rough
with my precious guest.

00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:47.420
We've got a visual on the Moroboshi house
in Tomobiki Town now. Over.

00:15:51.210 --> 00:15:53.290
What in god's name is that monster?!

00:15:56.630 --> 00:15:58.250
Darling, you big dummy!

00:15:58.250 --> 00:16:00.250
B-Bo! Please come down!

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:07.210
YETI ATTACK IN THE HEART OF TOKYO!!

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:07.210
Man trapped in its

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:07.210
clutches atop a roof

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:07.210
Police and firefighters

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:07.210
left dumbfounded

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:07.210
Yuki-onna and her secret lover

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:07.210
Ataru Moroboshi

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:07.210
It's all over the news today.

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:08.750
You better learn your lesson from this!

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:10.080
Yeah, whatever.

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:12.880
Please just hurry up and
close that damn portal already.

00:16:14.250 --> 00:16:16.750
You're back here again, B-Bo?

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:20.500
Seriously. My cold is never
gonna get better at this rate.

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:22.040
Speaking of which,

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:26.250
Mendo's taken every day off
from school ever since we came back...

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:31.380
Only one man stayed behind, huh?

00:16:31.710 --> 00:16:34.130
I was on the verge of having Lum's
husband wrapped around my finger.

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:35.210
It's such a shame...

00:16:35.210 --> 00:16:36.790
You're such a stud!

00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:38.580
Keep shoveling, hot stuff!

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:40.790
Earth guys are so amazing!

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.460
Anything for you ladies!

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:44.130
What a gentleman!

00:16:44.130 --> 00:16:45.210
You can do it!

00:16:45.210 --> 00:16:46.670
We love you!

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:28.670
And with that, the first semester
of this year comes to an end.

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:31.630
Make sure to do your summer homework.

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:32.920
That's all!

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:38.790
Darling! Let's walk home together!

00:18:40.630 --> 00:18:41.920
Wait just a minute.

00:18:44.380 --> 00:18:45.630
Hold the phone!

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:49.290
I have an important announcement to make!

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:51.580
Everyone get back to your seats!

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:53.040
Huh? What's this about?

00:18:57.290 --> 00:18:58.460
Quiet down!

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:02.420
Ahem.

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:06.040
As you know, I am Ataru Moroboshi.

00:19:06.880 --> 00:19:08.540
And as of today...

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:11.330
I will be retiring!

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:13.830
PAFOOOOOOOM!

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:18.580
Ataru Retires

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:23.290
Well, catch you on the flip side.

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:25.040
Hold on, Moroboshi!

00:19:25.670 --> 00:19:27.330
Don't bother trying to stop me.

00:19:27.330 --> 00:19:30.330
There's nothing left to say.
We're done here.

00:19:31.420 --> 00:19:33.040
I'm leaving now.

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:36.460
Have you talked with
our parents about this?

00:19:36.460 --> 00:19:38.080
I'm not a kid.

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:39.830
I can make this decision on my own.

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:42.330
That may be, but you're still a minor!

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:43.960
How do you intend to live?

00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:45.960
By doing what I've always done.

00:19:45.960 --> 00:19:47.790
Now I'll just have a little more freedom.

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:50.380
I'm sorry, Moroboshi.

00:19:50.380 --> 00:19:51.290
Huh?

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:53.790
I never intended for that
report card I gave you earlier

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:55.790
to drive you to such extremes.

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:57.420
Wh-what do you mean by that?

00:19:57.420 --> 00:19:58.880
It's true...

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:00.880
your grades are the worst I've ever seen!

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:02.210
They hurt just to look at!

00:20:02.210 --> 00:20:03.960
But it's all my fault!

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:08.710
I should have taken your report card
and burned it to ashes!

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:12.630
Dude! What are you talking about?
This is embarrassing!

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:15.500
I knew Ataru's grades were bad,
but not THAT bad.

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:18.000
I didn't really give a damn
about my grades before,

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:20.000
but now it's actually hurting my pride...

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:23.130
Hold on. Then why did you
suddenly decide to quit coming here?

00:20:23.130 --> 00:20:25.170
I didn't say anything about quitting school!

00:20:25.170 --> 00:20:26.670
What I'm retiring from is...

00:20:26.670 --> 00:20:27.500
Cla-!
Moroboshi! You've made a wise choice.

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:29.210
Moroboshi! You've made a wise choice.

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:31.750
We get it. You don't have to say anything else.

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:33.420
I'm not sure you actually get it at all.

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:36.460
I've always thought you were totally unfit
for all the responsibilities that you have.

00:20:36.460 --> 00:20:38.210
Quit taking pot shots at me, dude.

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:41.040
Listen, everyone. Moroboshi is...

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:44.170
retiring from being the
main character of Urusei Yatsura!

00:20:44.170 --> 00:20:45.130
FLOPPO!

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:46.630
I figured that's what he meant.

00:20:46.630 --> 00:20:48.830
I never thought he was a good fit, anyway.

00:20:48.830 --> 00:20:50.750
Who do you think will be
the main character now?

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:53.210
What's the deal, Mendo?
You seem awfully chipper.

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:56.540
Come on. Based on looks there's no question
that the next best candidate is...

00:20:56.540 --> 00:20:58.210
Me, of course!

00:20:57.750 --> 00:20:58.290
Main Character

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:03.330
Cherry?! Where the hell'd you come from?!

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:06.500
Well, I heard you were having a contest
for the next main character...

00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:07.960
Just look at these simple lines!

00:21:07.960 --> 00:21:09.880
And my charming face!

00:21:09.880 --> 00:21:10.830
SMACK!

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:13.250
You must be out of your mind!
Have some shame!

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:14.790
Oh! It's Nurse Sakura!

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:17.330
Stop showing up
when it makes no lick of sense!

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:18.750
It's humiliating, darn it!

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:20.630
What are you doing here, Sakura?

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:22.170
Well, you know.

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:25.170
I need to give a speech and greet everyone.

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:26.080
After all...

00:21:26.080 --> 00:21:28.040
I'm going to be the main character now.

00:21:28.040 --> 00:21:29.460
You're no different from Cherry.

00:21:29.460 --> 00:21:31.040
I wanna be the main character, too!

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:32.000
But I'm the best fit.

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:33.290
No, it's obviously me.

00:21:33.290 --> 00:21:34.170
No, me!

00:21:34.750 --> 00:21:36.630
You all need to quit with this nonsense!

00:21:36.630 --> 00:21:38.420
It's too late to change the status quo now!

00:21:38.420 --> 00:21:39.460
Yeah, she's right!

00:21:39.460 --> 00:21:41.710
I've always been the
main character of this show!

00:21:42.290 --> 00:21:43.830
I'm the main character, dammit!

00:21:43.830 --> 00:21:45.380
Are you sure it's not me?

00:21:45.380 --> 00:21:47.250
I've been the main character
since episode 1!

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:49.210
Yeah, but you're going to retire, right?

00:21:49.210 --> 00:21:50.500
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:21:53.210 --> 00:21:55.670
Is this where the main character
contest is happening?

00:21:56.540 --> 00:21:58.750
Come along, everyone.
This seems to be the place.

00:22:00.130 --> 00:22:01.670
Whoa! What the hell?!

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:05.250
People from across the universe have come
to take their shot at being main character.

00:22:06.330 --> 00:22:08.750
So many rivals...

00:22:09.210 --> 00:22:11.580
I guess everyone was feeling
pretty unhappy

00:22:11.580 --> 00:22:13.830
with you in the main character
spot, Moroboshi.

00:22:13.830 --> 00:22:16.830
I think it's time for us to make it clear
who reigns supreme.

00:22:16.830 --> 00:22:19.130
Then let's make this a
contest of physical strength!

00:22:19.130 --> 00:22:21.210
The hopes of my whole planet
are riding on my shoulders,

00:22:21.210 --> 00:22:23.130
so I can't afford to lose.

00:22:23.130 --> 00:22:25.750
I'm always raring for
more screentime, ya know!

00:22:26.170 --> 00:22:28.380
What are you going to do, Ataru?

00:22:29.250 --> 00:22:30.750
All I wanted...

00:22:31.170 --> 00:22:36.460
WAS RETIRE FROM BEING THE
CLASS PRESIDENT, GODDAMMIIIIIIIT!

00:22:31.420 --> 00:22:35.580
Class President

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:41.080
Wait, you're the class president?

00:22:41.080 --> 00:22:42.420
Why not just quit?

00:22:43.710 --> 00:22:45.830
I'm the real main character, of course!

00:22:46.790 --> 00:22:51.710
Home Is Where You Find It

00:22:46.790 --> 00:22:51.710
Marine Garbage Disposal

00:22:47.130 --> 00:22:49.580
On the next episode of Urusei Yatsura!

00:22:49.580 --> 00:22:51.170
His name is Pochi!
